{"unit_id": "linkingoscar__dsh-billing-glass#feature-1", "repo": "linkingoscar/dsh-billing-glass", "commit": "07a37acb85aa2136d78fa78a117b3ab4988b715d", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-billing-glass 的功能「供应商与会话计费面板」：在 Web 悬浮卡展示供应商余额、活动模型和会话费用，并汇总 token 分桶数据。界面从状态路由读取数据，可在供应商间查看。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["src/client/index.js:13"]}
{"unit_id": "linkingoscar__dsh-billing-glass#feature-2", "repo": "linkingoscar/dsh-billing-glass", "commit": "07a37acb85aa2136d78fa78a117b3ab4988b715d", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-billing-glass 的功能「消息费用角标」：在 assistant 消息操作区显示单条消息的计价信息。计价逻辑按消息来源匹配供应商和模型，并将无价格模型标为未计价。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["src/client/index.js:19"]}
{"unit_id": "linkingoscar__dsh-billing-glass#feature-3", "repo": "linkingoscar/dsh-billing-glass", "commit": "07a37acb85aa2136d78fa78a117b3ab4988b715d", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-billing-glass 的功能「本地消费账本」：按会话和消息记录费用并生成今日、月度及累计汇总；持久化日志回放与实时记录按 messageId 合并，避免重复计入。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/ledger.js:1"]}
{"unit_id": "linkingoscar__dsh-billing-glass#caveat-1", "repo": "linkingoscar/dsh-billing-glass", "commit": "07a37acb85aa2136d78fa78a117b3ab4988b715d", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-billing-glass 的 session cost 与消费汇总按本地模型价格表和消息 token 估算，不能保证等同供应商最终账单；无法识别价格的模型会标为未计价。 (见 lib/session-costing.js:124)", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/session-costing.js:124"]}
